 3. 🇨🇳 Jensen lover&#x27;s spy ties 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang greets Chinese businesswoman Alice Huang after delivering a speech in Taipei, Taiwan, in 2024. Photo: Ann Wang/Reuters The Chinese businesswoman who had an affair with former Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang "kept in contact with an official of China's top spy agency" during their relationship, The New York Times' Jonathan Swan, Julian Barnes and Maggie Haberman report . 

 Why it matters: Alice Huang's contacts with the spy agency help explain how U.S. officials came to believe Jensen Huang was the target of a Chinese intelligence operation. 🔎 Zoom in: She was in touch with an officer of China's Ministry of State Security from spring 2025 until this fall, the Times reports.

 U.S. intelligence agencies also gathered evidence that her business partner, Kang Wei, who was often introduced as her husband, worked with the same agency. Via Truth Social Trump posted last night that he hopes Nvidia's board rehires him, saying it "would be the best thing for the Company, and also, for the U.S.A."

