 8. 🎮 1 fun thing: $100K gamer 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Image : Rockstar Games An unknown video game streamer beat out 33,000+ other applicants to land a Kalshi job as a Grand Theft Auto VI researcher, Bloomberg reports . 

 The streamer — 36-year-old Cliff Savage — will make more than $100,000 to play the game to completion and report on the "real-world fallout" from the blockbuster hit. Go deeper (gift link). 

 
 
